  "source": "skills/ui-evaluator/references/knowledge/content-copy.md (CPY-01, CPY-02, CPY-04, CPY-06, CPY-09, CPY-19 Tables A and B) and anti-slop.md (SLP-12…SLP-15); QUALITY-BAR CPY-01…CPY-04 and SLP-13…SLP-15 for the strings the gates name.",
  "note": "Patterns are JavaScript regular-expression sources. They are matched case-insensitively with the u flag unless an entry sets `flags`. Entries with `heuristic: true` are UI-Evaluator renderings beyond the strings the knowledge files name: they prompt review and are [calibrating]. A word in both Table A and Table B counts as Table B (content-copy.md CPY-19).",
