      "level": "advisory",
      "table": "A",
      "attribution": "Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.",
      "adapted_from": "GOV.UK A to Z style guide, plain-English words to avoid",
      "description": "Plain-English words to avoid. Flag figurative uses only: literal and domain uses pass (deploy a build, an API key, keyboard focus, a progress bar). Entries marked `ambiguous` are common literal UI words; `uie lint` does not report them because only a reader can tell the figurative use.",
      "entries": [
